    "description": "The Hotel Loyalty Points History Retrieval API allows consumers to access detailed records of hotel loyalty points transactions for members. Users can retrieve historical data regarding points earned, redeemed, and the status of their loyalty points. This API is particularly useful for hotel management systems, customer service platforms, and loyalty program administrators who need to provide customers with an overview of their loyalty program activity. By leveraging this endpoint, businesses can enhance customer engagement and improve loyalty program transparency.",
